{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10335","headline":"酬李少府 · 高适","name":"酬李少府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"出塞魂屡惊，怀贤意难说。\n谁知吾道间，乃在客中别。\n日夕捧琼瑶，相思无休歇。\n伊人虽薄宦，举代推高节。\n述作凌江山，声华满冰雪。\n一登蓟丘上，四顾何惨烈。\n来雁无尽时，边风正骚屑。\n将从崖谷遁，且与沈浮绝。\n君若登青云，余当投魏阙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10335.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10335","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}